Subject: [PATCH 12/36] =?UTF-8?q?Mer=20:=20=C3=A9cume=20du=20sillage=20ado?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ucie=20(plus=20de=20semis=20de=20points=20clairs=20autour=20de?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Jak=20sur=20l'eau=20sombre)?=
